    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Commissar Yarrick",
    "summary": "While Counterstrategist is active through Hero of Hades Hive, use it as the opponent’s Movement phase ends. Pick an enemy that finished a move or was set up within 8″ of Yarrick. Within 6″ of Yarrick, choose a friendly REGIMENT unit he can see. That unit is ineligible if it took a Normal Move or was targeted by Fire Overwatch during this phase. Choose one response. Move up to D6″ using a Normal Move, shoot solely at the chosen enemy subject to normal target eligibility, or declare a charge. For the rest of the phase, its ranged attacks hit on unmodified 6s regardless of Ballistic Skill or modifiers. The Charge Move must engage the chosen enemy. A successful charge grants the REGIMENT unit no Charge Bonus this turn.",
